#. ちょっと待って！　掃除当番じゃなくても、
#. <CLT 3>証拠を処分する方法<CLT>はあったはずだよ！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hold on! I think I know how someone could <CLT 3>dispose of\n"
"the evidence<CLT> without using the trash room key!"
msgstr ""

#. だが、鉄格子を開けなければ、
#. 焼却炉の火を付ける事は出来んのだぞ？
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But if you can't get past the gate, you couldn't\n"
"possibly turn on the incinerator, could you?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、それが可能だったんだよ。
#. これを使えばね…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yes, you could. If you used this."
msgstr ""

#. 割れちまってるけど…
#. ガラス玉みてーだな…
msgctxt "0004 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"What is it, some kinda glass ball? It's busted to\n"
"hell..."
msgstr ""

#. いや、<CLT 3>水晶玉<CLT>…のはずだったんだけども…
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Actually, it was supposed to be a <CLT 3>crystal ball<CLT>. But,\n"
"uh..."
msgstr ""

#. これを使うって…どうやって使うのぉ？
msgctxt "0006 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "But...how would you use it?"
msgstr ""

#. 投げる
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Throw it"
msgstr ""

#. 転がす
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Roll it"
msgstr ""

#. 多分、犯人は転がして使ったんだよ…
#. ボウリングの玉のようにね…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The killer most likely used it like a bowling ball,\n"
"and rolled it..."
msgstr ""

#. それで、焼却炉のスイッチを押したんだよ！
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And that's how they pressed the switch on the\n"
"incinerator!"
msgstr ""

#. 転がしても…スイッチには届かないんじゃ…？
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But...there's no way for it to hit that switch if you\n"
"just rolled it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 占う
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Divine with it"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は占ったんだよ…
#. 山田クンが鉄格子を開ける時間帯を…！
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The killer used it...to divine what time Hifumi would\n"
"open the gate!"
msgstr ""

#. そして鉄格子が開いた隙に、
#. 焼却炉を使ったんだ！
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And with the gate open, they strolled right in and\n"
"used the incinerator!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…犯人は葉隠って事になんのか？
msgctxt "0016 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Then...Hiro's the killer?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事まで占える訳ないだろ！
#. むしろ、俺が弟子入りしたいべ！
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hell no! I could never divine something like that!\n"
"Hell, I wanna be their apprentice!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あなたが発言しなければ、
#. 議論は進まないわ。
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you don't do something, the trial can't move\n"
"forward."
msgstr ""

#. 時間には限りがある…
#. 最悪の結果をあなたは望んでいるの？
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We don't have all the time in the world. You're not\n"
"*trying* to lose this case, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人はこのガラス玉を使って、
#. ある事をやったはずだ。それは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer had to use the glass ball in a certain way.\n"
"Which was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は鉄格子の隙間から、このガラス玉を投げたんだ。
#. 焼却炉のスイッチ目掛けてね…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The killer simply took aim at the incinerator switch\n"
"and threw the ball through a gap in the gate."
msgstr ""

#. そうやって焼却炉のスイッチを押す事で、
#. 焼却炉に火を付けたんだ！
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"All they had to do was hit that switch, and the\n"
"incinerator would come to life."
msgstr ""

#. 鉄格子の隙間から…投げた…？
msgctxt "0025 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Someone threw that...through a gap in the gate!?"
msgstr ""

#. 山田クンは…前に言ってたよね？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Remember what you said before, Hifumi?"
msgstr ""

#. およよぉ！
#. 焼却炉の火が点けっ放しじゃないですかぁ！？
msgctxt "0027 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Huh!? Someone turned the incinerator on!"
msgstr ""

#. おっかしいな…前に来た時は、
#. ちゃんと火は消えていたはずなのですが…
msgctxt "0028 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Very strange... I'm quite certain it was off last time\n"
"I was down here."
msgstr ""

#. 妖精さんの仕業？
msgctxt "0029 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Perhaps it was the work of a fairy..."
msgstr ""

#. 鍵を持っていた山田クンの知らない内に、
#. 焼却炉の火が付いてたのは…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hifumi had the key, so the only way the incinerator\n"
"could have been turned on without his knowledge..."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が、鉄格子を開けずに、
#. 焼却炉のスイッチを押したからだったんだ。
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...was because the killer was able to hit the switch\n"
"*without* opening the gate."
msgstr ""

#. そうやって焼却炉の火を付けたところで、
#. そこに、丸めたワイシャツを投げ込んだんだよ！
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Once they'd gotten the incinerator going, all they had\n"
"to do was ball up the shirt and toss it in!"
msgstr ""

#. お、おい……何言ってんだよ……
msgctxt "0033 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "H-Hey, come on...what the hell is this?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が鉄格子の中に入っていない事は、
#. 証拠隠滅後の状況が物語っているわ…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"All you have to do is look at the scene to know that\n"
"the killer never actually went inside the trash room."
msgstr ""

#. 割れたガラス玉…付けっ放しの焼却炉の火…
#. 燃えカスが残ってしまったという雑な処分方法…
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The shards of broken glass, the incinerator left\n"
"running, the piece of shirt that escaped the fire..."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番が犯人なら、
#. もっと丁寧に、証拠を隠滅しているはずよ…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If the killer had been on cleaning duty, the evidence\n"
"would have been taken care of much more thoroughly."
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…ちょっと待てって…！
msgctxt "0037 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "W-Wait, no...just hold on!"
msgstr ""

#. でもさぁ、鉄格子から焼却炉までって、
#. <CLT 3>１０メートル以上<CLT>は離れてたよねぇ…？
msgctxt "0038 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"But the distance from the gate to the incinerator has\n"
"to be at least...<CLT 3>thirty feet<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな距離から、ガラス玉を投げて、
#. ピンポイントでスイッチに当てるなんて…
msgctxt "0039 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"The pinpoint accuracy you'd need to throw a glass ball\n"
"that far and hit something that small..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事…本当に出来るのかなぁ…？
msgctxt "0040 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Could someone really do that?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだ…！
#. そんなの不可能に決まってんじゃん！
msgctxt "0041 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Th-That's right! There's no way! It'd be impossible!"
msgstr ""

#. 難しいかもしれないけど…
#. でも、不可能じゃないはずだよ…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Difficult, absolutely. Impossible? I don't think so.\n"
"Because the killer is..."
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の野球選手
msgctxt "0043 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Ultimate Baseball Star"
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の同人作家
msgctxt "0044 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Ultimate Fanfic Creator"
msgstr ""

#. だって、犯人は“超高校級の同人作家”だったから…
#. そうだよね、山田クン…？
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because the killer is the Ultimate Fanfic Creator.\n"
"Isn't that right, Hifumi!?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の流れで、ご指名ですかぁ！？
msgctxt "0046 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Huh? Why am I part of the conversation all of a\n"
"sudden!?"
msgstr ""

#. 僕は、正確なコピーで同人を作る事は出来ても、
#. 正確なコントロールは持ち合わせておりませんぞ！
msgctxt "0047 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Sure, I've got the dexterity to draw a comic with the\n"
"best of 'em, but my accuracy is total garbage!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の占い師
msgctxt "0049 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Ultimate Clairvoyant"
msgstr ""

#. だって、犯人は“超高校級の占い師”だったから…
#. そうだよね、葉隠クン…？
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because the killer is the Ultimate Clairvoyant. Isn't\n"
"that right, Hiro!?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、ここは決めるトコだべ…
#. それともマジで俺だと思ってんのか？
msgctxt "0051 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, c'mon. Now's when we get down to the nitty\n"
"gritty. Or...do you seriously think I did it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今は発言しなければ、議論は進まないわ。
msgctxt "0053 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you don't do something, the trial can't move\n"
"forward."
msgstr ""

#. 時間には限りがある…
#. 最悪の結果をあなたは望んでいるの？
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We don't have all the time in the world. You're not\n"
"*trying* to lose this case, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、犯人にとっては難しくさえなかったのかも…
#. だって犯人は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It wouldn't have been much of a challenge at all for\n"
"the killer. Because...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だって、犯人は<CLT 3>“超高校級の野球選手”<CLT>だったから…
#. そうだよね、桑田クン…？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because the killer is the <CLT 3>Ultimate Baseball Star<CLT>.\n"
"Isn't that right, Leon!?"
msgstr ""

#. バ、バカ言ってんじゃ…ねーって…！
msgctxt "0058 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"D-Do you have any idea how stupid you sound right\n"
"now!?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、超高校級の野球選手と称される彼なら、
#. １０メートル先の的など大した事ないでしょうね。
msgctxt "0059 | CELES"
msgid ""
"A target thirty feet away would surely be little\n"
"challenge for the Ultimate Baseball Star."
msgstr ""

#. ふ、ふ、ふ、ふ、ふ、ふざけんな…！
#. オレは…オレは……！
msgctxt "0060 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Y-Y-Y-You can't be serious! I...! I...!"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人なんかじゃねぇっつーのぉ！！
msgctxt "0061 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "I'm not the killer!"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、今の推理だって、ぜんっぜん間違ってんだよ！
#. このクソボケウンコタレっ！！
msgctxt "0062 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"These goddamn shit-for-brains have got it all wrong,\n"
"I'm telling you!"
msgstr ""

#. まだ認めないのね。だったら…
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You still won't admit it? Okay then..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君…もう１度、事件を振り返って、
#. 彼の犯行のすべてを明らかにするのよ…
msgctxt "0064 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Makoto, go ahead and review the incident one more time\n"
"to make his crime perfectly clear."
msgstr ""

#. それで…終わりにさせましょう……
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And with that, we can end this..."
msgstr ""

#. だ・か・ら！
#. 何が終わりだってんだよッ！！
msgctxt "0066 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Listen to me! What the hell do you mean, end this!?"
msgstr ""

#. …桑田クン、キミがなんて言おうと、
#. すべての謎はもう解けてるんだ…
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Say what you want, Leon. But all the questions have\n"
"been answered, and the truth has been revealed."
msgstr ""

#. 今回の事件の答えは、これだ！
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Now here's what happened...!"
msgstr ""
